1111..1183 Comment "/// The operator\'s turn: at its own world, holding one capability to the"
1184..1256 Comment "/// seat\'s, it runs the seat\'s work there and takes the report back. The"
1257..1333 Comment "/// migration spends the capability, and the report crosses because its type"
1334..1355 Comment "/// is marked mobile."
